name: Read finite scope passes and inspect exact job inputs without spending or losing a draft
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: NODE_OPTIONS KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/fixed_job_reader.py @TMP_TARGET @ART @TMP_HOME seed
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: campaign owned-added-scope-study
require-live-snap: 25 Hello CLI · pass 1/3 | human-fixed-jobs
expect: 12 planned
expect-not: ✓ hello-cli
type: private unfinished draft
nav-mode:
keys: C-_
keys: Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down
require-live-snap: 20 Greeting discovery · pass 1/3 | selected-greeting
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 SELECTED JOB | recorded-job-detail
expect: Greeting discovery · pass 1/3
expect: planned
ask: Does the finite list identify scopes and passes clearly, with recorded execution state instead of inclusion ticks, and does Enter inspect the selected job?
resize: 160x48
require-live-snap: 15 SELECTED JOB | detail-160x48
resize: 96x89
require-live-snap: 15 SELECTED JOB | detail-96x89
resize: 80x24
require-live-snap: 15 SELECTED JOB | detail-80x24
resize: 60x20
require-live-snap: 15 SELECTED JOB | detail-60x20
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 15 SELECTED JOB | detail-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: detail-paged-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: scope-reference-paged-40x12
keys: NPage
require-live-snap: 15 Supplemental context: | context-omissions-40x12
expect: omitted
ask: Can the operator read exact recorded scope, context omissions, attempts and unknown cost at all sizes, with paging and return controls visible?
keys: Up
require-live-snap: 20 Root integration | previous-job-detail
keys: q
require-live-snap: 20 Root integration | restored-job-selection
expect: pass 3/3
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 private unfinished draft | retained-composer
keys: C-u
resize: 120x36
nav-mode:
keys: L
require-live-snap: 20 launch failed | unapproved-launch-refused
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/fixed_job_reader.py @TMP_TARGET @ART @TMP_HOME refused
ask: Does inspection and return preserve the draft and job selection while unapproved launch leaves all twelve jobs unstarted and the plan unchanged?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
submit: campaign owned-added-scope-study
require-live-snap: 25 Hello CLI · pass 1/3 | recovered-pass-labels
nav-mode:
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 SELECTED JOB | recovered-job-detail
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/fixed_job_reader.py @TMP_TARGET @ART @TMP_HOME restarted
ask: Does no-color restart retain the same recorded labels and readable job inputs without creating approval, attempts, requests or source changes?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
